  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Qué significa una señal",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Security** se apoya en señales que sí tenemos en el stack gratuito: tráfico/presión desde OTEL del backend y auth/offenders desde Loki. Los smokes firmados (`staging-smoke-cleanup`, `staging-browser-smoke`) y el namespace legacy `ci_smoke_<16hex>` quedan fuera de rankings/forensics auth pero siguen en Log Explorer. El ranking por IP muestra quién insiste más; `IPs ofensivas únicas · por país` deduplica por `(client_country, client_ip)`. Las métricas Cloudflare de Analytics/WAF de pago están deliberadamente fuera de este dashboard."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Auth IP bans · 15 min",
      "description": "Bloqueos activados por el guard real del backend: 10 fallos en 10 min → 15 min de bloqueo.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"} |= \"auth_ip_ban_activated\" [15m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Auth identity blocks · 15 min",
      "description": "Bloqueos activados por el guard distribuido por identidad: 20 fallos sobre la misma identidad en 10 min → 5 min de bloqueo.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"} |= \"auth_login_identity_ban_activated\" [15m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "401/403/429 · 15 min",
      "description": "Respuestas de rechazo/limitación vistas por el backend en el entorno seleccionado.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"} | json | __error__=\"\" | event=\"http_request\" | synthetic_source!~\"staging-(smoke-cleanup|browser-smoke)\" | status=~\"401|403|429\" [15m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests backend · 15 min",
      "description": "Requests reales observadas por el backend vía OTEL en el entorno seleccionado. No depende de Cloudflare Analytics.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(chess_studio_http_server_requests_total{service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"}[15m])) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Presión backend · requests/s vs baseline 1 h",
      "description": "Requests/s reales del backend vía OTEL: compara la tasa a 5 min con la media a 1 h. Un multiplicador alto es una señal a investigar, no una clasificación automática de DoS.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(chess_studio_http_server_requests_total{service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "actual · 5m",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(chess_studio_http_server_requests_total{service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"}[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "baseline · 1h",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Auth failures y bloqueos · evolución",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"} | json | __error__=\"\" | event=\"auth_login_failed\" | synthetic_source!~\"staging-(smoke-cleanup|browser-smoke)\" | user_agent!=\"chess-studio-staging-smoke-cleanup/2\" | username_attempted!~\"ci_smoke_[0-9a-f]{16}\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "login failures",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"} |= \"auth_ip_ban_activated\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "IP bans",
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${logs_datasource_uid}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service_name=~\"${backend_service:raw}\"} |= \"auth_login_identity_ban_activated\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "identity blocks",
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
